{'symbol': 'ACN', 'date': '2020-04-20 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Accenture agrees to buy French company Gekko', 'text': '* Accenture has agreed to acquire Gekko, a leading French Amazon Web Services (AWS) cloud services company .* Since its inception in 2015, Gekko has helped more than 80 clients, including some of the largest French companies, design, deploy and maintain a flexible, connected and secure cloud infrastructure..* For clients in France and across Europe, the acquisition of Gekko would strengthen Accenture’s general and industry-specific cloud experience in AWS technologies.'}{'symbol': 'ALXN', 'date': '2020-04-20 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Alexion Announces Plans To Initiate Phase 3 Study Of Ultomiris® In Hospitalized Patients With Severe Covid-19', 'text': 'ALEXION ANNOUNCES PLANS TO INITIATE PHASE 3 STUDY OF ULTOMIRIS® (RAVULIZUMAB-CWVZ) IN HOSPITALIZED PATIENTS WITH SEVERE COVID-19.ALEXION PHARMACEUTICALS - GLOBAL STUDY TO ENROLL APPROXIMATELY 270 ADULTS WITH COVID-19 AND SEVERE PNEUMONIA OR ACUTE RESPIRATORY DISTRESS SYNDROME.ALEXION PHARMACEUTICALS INC - MAINTAINS COMMITMENT TO SUPPLYING ITS MEDICINES TO PATIENTS FOR CURRENTLY APPROVED INDICATIONS.'}{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2020-04-20 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Accenture agrees to buy French company Gekko', 'text': '* Accenture has agreed to acquire Gekko, a leading French Amazon Web Services (AWS) cloud services company .* Since its inception in 2015, Gekko has helped more than 80 clients, including some of the largest French companies, design, deploy and maintain a flexible, connected and secure cloud infrastructure..* For clients in France and across Europe, the acquisition of Gekko would strengthen Accenture’s general and industry-specific cloud experience in AWS technologies.'}{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2020-04-20 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'United Airlines Reports Q1 Results', 'text': 'UNITED AIRLINES INC -  FOR FIRST-QUARTER OF 2020, CO AND UNIT RECORDED A PRE-TAX LOSS OF $2.1 BILLION, $1.